    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15985" root="رغب" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْغَبٌ</span></b>  [<i>A place,</i> or <i>time, of desire</i> or <i>wish:</i>
and hence, <i>an object thereof</i>]. You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَطَبَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَأَصَابَ المَرْغَبَ</span> [app. meaning <i>He demanded a
woman in marriage, and attained the object of
desire</i>]. (A.)

